# One Dropbox folder per line (always starting with "/"). Blank lines or
# lines starting with "#" are ignored.
#
# Copy this file to scripts/folders.txt (without the .example) and edit it
# with the actual folders you want to monitor. scripts/folders.txt is not
# checked into git (it's in .gitignore), so it stays local to this machine.
#
# Examples:
# /_PodcastsFC/Xadrez Verbal
# /_PodcastsFC/Lex Fridman Podcast
# /_AudioMemosFC/MamyCalls
